    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44263" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐϋκνήμῑς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑδος</span>,
			ὁ, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>well-greaved</i>, freq. in nom.
			and acc. pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐϋκνήμῑδες,
			ἐϋκνήμῑδας</span>, in <i><span class="en">
				Il.
			</span></i> always epith. of 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀχαιοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.17
				</span></i>
			, al.; in <i><span class="en">
				Od.
			</span></i> also of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑταῖροι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				2.402
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				9.550
			</span></i>: gen. sg. as fem., -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κνήμῑδος
				Ἰτώνης</span> Poet. ap. <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				519.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>with goodly spokes</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπήνη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					7.140
				</span></i>
			.</div>
